safix::source_has_no_value

  × the mapping 'wg-key' exports wg-private for alice, which holds no value
  │ yet.
  │ 
  │ secrets/safix/users/alice/secrets.yaml does not carry the key. Evaluation
  │ could not have caught this: an
  │ entry declares where a value lives, not that one is there, and the two
  │ are the same declaration until something reads the file.
  │ 
  │ Put a value there first:
  │ 
  │     safix generate alice wg-private
  │ 
  │ or, if this value is not to be minted after all, set it by hand:
  │ 
  │     safix set alice wg-private
